  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **We are Ween (stage talk)**: back after 90 archived shows (1511 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Powder Blue**: back after 42 archived shows (849 days) [2]\n- **Pumpin' 4 the Man**: back after 50 archived shows (903 days) [2]\n- **Shamemaker**: back after 36 archived shows (792 days) [2]\n- **Band on the Run**: back after 253 archived shows (3525 days) [2]\n- **Fluffy**: back after 35 archived shows (791 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-12-29.tt.aud.mkh8040.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 32 songs; 153 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-12-29.tt.aud.mkh8040.flac16**: taped by TT; transferred by TT; source: Sennheiser MKH8040 -> Aerco MP-2 -> Sony M-10 (24/48k) [1]. Also: Recorded with Sennheiser MKH8040 microphones into an Aerco MP-2 preamp and a Sony M-10 at 24-bit/48k; Transferred via MacBook and Adobe Audition CS5.5 with light EQ, levels and fades; split in Fission, encoded to FLAC, converted to 16/44.1k [1]",
